==Problem description==
Raspberry Pi issues with powering on, not staying powered on, randomly power cycles, or the red power LED flickers.

* Pi '''1''' (A+ and B+)
* Pi '''2''' (all)
* Pi '''3''' (B only)
* Pi '''Zero''' (all)

[[File:Placeholder image.jpg|thumb|Example image (Figure 1) -- No image yet. Help expand this page by uploading it!]]
==Symptoms==
'''Power issues''' like the following:

* System doesn't turn on or turns off immediately after turning on
* System runs fine for 10 minutes, then turns off and won't turn on again for some time.
* Red PWR LED flickers or turns off completely (if present)
* 5V present at GPIO 2, but no 3.3V on GPIO 1

==Solution==
See [[Raspberry Pi Faulty PAM2306 Repair]]